      en: ["Served as a high-security prison from 1960 to 1984.", "Designated as a National Natural Park in 1984.", "Located 35 km off the Pacific coast of Colombia.", "Key breeding ground for humpback whales (July-Oct).", "Home to the endemic blue anole lizard.", "The island has a total land area of about 26 sq km."],
